Track 1: Iron Scars the Mist
- Story & Context: Old Man Tibor, foreman of Sector 7, found his pickaxe blunted by a newly discovered vein of quartz, sparking a fury that led him to beat out rhythms on the emergency air pipes; the sharp metallic echo was the first Vent-Strike. "This damn rock, it bleeds a new song!"
